   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Blue Economies Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Blue Planet Fund programme aims to enhance the resilience of Small Island Developing States (SIDS) &amp; their economies to the impacts of climate change, as well as exploring opportunities for SIDS to generate revenue from carbon offset schemes through protection of their critical marine habitats.</narrative>
  </description>
